 in front of him, and every now and then","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T21:46:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4871350-1843481262702832","game_id":"steam-4871350","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.1.23: a cleaner table and a shop that explains itself","summary":"Howdy! Version 0.1.23 is out, and the free demo has it too. Most of this update is about the table itself: what you read while you play, what stands in your way, and what the smuggler actually sells you. One callout at a time \"Your turn\", your score, \"Took the lead!\" and the opponent's house rule used to fire at the same moment and land right on top of each other. They now wait until the table is clear and come one after another. Anything that is already outdated by then is dropped instead of sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:51:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702832","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4871350-1842212951305423","game_id":"steam-4871350","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.1.20: The Lanterns Are Lit and the Outlaws Have Bodies","summary":"Light, because the game had exactly one of everything I measured it before touching anything: on four of the five main screens more than 80 percent of the image sat close to black, and up to 99 percent of all colored pixels sat in the same brown and gold wedge. One hue, one brightness. The lanterns painted into the backgrounds did not actually light anything. Now they do. Every scene knows where its lamps burn, and the bright core sits on the flame instead of next to it. The gold got its highlig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T11:07:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305423","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4871350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4871350":"2026-10-26T14:53:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4871350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:18Z"},"5081710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:19Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4871350","app_id":4871350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b612889a6771ad397724661e312463e6dfa80302c3e8b44ca4c3e255fa7dad18","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Yathsel is a Wild West dice roguelite: play crooked Yahtzee-style hands, sneak loaded artifact dice from the smuggler under the table, and cheat your way past gunslinging rivals in a solo campaign, quick duels, and online saloons with ranked 1v1 for up to 8 players.","publishers":[{"name":"urdentstudios"}],"developers":[{"name":"urdentstudios"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Movie Yathsel","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791920936